GOOD EXAMPLE - ranked use-case report:
User request: "Conduct a comprehensive deep research report on the top 10 highest-value use cases of AI in 2026. For each use case cover what it is, why it is high-value with ROI/cost/revenue evidence, real-world examples, maturity, enabling technologies, adoption barriers, who benefits most. Rank by business value and transformative potential. Prioritize analyst reports and credible 2025-2026 sources. Include executive summary, ranked list, detailed sections, and final insight for 2027-2028."
{
  "title": "Top 10 Highest-Value AI Use Cases in 2026",
  "sections": [
    "Executive Summary and Ranking Criteria",
    "Ranked Top 10 AI Use Cases",
    "Business Impact, ROI, and Efficiency Evidence",
    "2025-2026 Real-World Deployment Examples",
    "Maturity Levels and Enabling Technologies",
    "Adoption Barriers and Best-Fit Beneficiaries",
    "2027-2028 AI Value Creation Outlook"
  ]
}

